    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lbtc30r",
      "content": "• Impeachment requires a special majority in both Houses of Parliament."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pqoyftn",
      "content": "• The grounds for removal are proved misbehavior or incapacity."
    },
    {
      "id": "3eeiyqh",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Jurisdiction of the Supreme Court"
    },
    {
      "id": "uc7gek2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Original Jurisdiction (Article 131)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4t14pl0",
      "content": "Disputes between the Union and States or between States."
    },
    {
      "id": "qbzjk7s",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Appellate Jurisdiction"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ydo00n0",
      "content": "Appeals from High Courts in constitutional, civil and criminal matters."
    },
    {
      "id": "4iyk38j",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Advisory Jurisdiction (Article 143)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ceqawpj",
      "content": "The President can seek the opinion of the Supreme Court."
    },
    {
      "id": "tdu7eld",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. Writ Jurisdiction"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 131 deals exclusively with disputes between the Centre and States or between States, excluding private citizens.",
        "Under Article 143 (Advisory Jurisdiction), the Supreme Court's opinion is advisory in nature and not binding on the President.",
        "Distinguish between Article 32 (Supreme Court Writ Jurisdiction - Fundamental Rights only) and Article 226 (High Court Writ Jurisdiction - broader scope)."
      ],
      "id": "dqt7doh"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dwhvdf1",
      "content": "The Supreme Court can issue writs under Article 32 for enforcement of Fundamental Rights."
    },
    {
      "id": "8mof8mg",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
